WEBVTT

00:04.250 --> 00:07.500
Chant! Dia Chronos!

00:05.790 --> 00:08.110
<b>Dia Chronos</b>

00:26.560 --> 00:27.750
Lululee!

00:29.130 --> 00:30.170
Lowe!

00:32.580 --> 00:34.110
Lowe!

00:42.110 --> 00:45.050
I have not attained full
mastery of this body yet.

00:45.050 --> 00:49.570
Does this mean the dark god's 
core has not fully activated?

00:50.690 --> 00:54.060
It's okay. They're only unconscious.

00:54.580 --> 00:56.540
Glen let a dark god consume his own soul

00:56.860 --> 00:59.990
in order to activate the dark god's core.

01:00.480 --> 01:06.000
But he didn't kill Lululee or Lowe,
even though he's more than capable of it.

01:06.980 --> 01:09.520
Glen's consciousness might still be in there.

01:10.170 --> 01:13.930
If we can destroy the dark god's core,
we can get the old Glen back.

01:15.000 --> 01:16.760
I'll stake it all on that possibility.

01:17.210 --> 01:20.260
But if he loses the core, he'll also be...

01:20.620 --> 01:23.210
It's the only way.

03:04.940 --> 03:06.940
Knowing Glen, he'll target me next.

03:07.530 --> 03:10.370
He always defeats the weakest 
first and works his way up.

03:11.030 --> 03:14.640
Look for an opportunity to 
attack while I keep him busy.

03:15.360 --> 03:16.340
Got it.

03:38.140 --> 03:39.930
<i>Since he can stop time,</i>

03:40.280 --> 03:42.660
<i>I can't see the motions 
that precede his attacks.</i>

03:42.660 --> 03:44.950
<i>I can't evade them reflexively, either.</i>

03:44.950 --> 03:47.950
<i>He has no openings for a counterattack!</i>

04:06.040 --> 04:08.250
I'm the one you're fighting!

04:14.430 --> 04:18.110
Hmph. Still as uselessly tough as ever, I see.

04:18.310 --> 04:22.900
<i>"As ever"? So he still has Glen's memories.</i>

04:27.400 --> 04:30.230
Skill activate! Sigurth Beast!

04:30.450 --> 04:33.210
What do you hope to achieve with that?

04:51.980 --> 04:56.230
Do you know why I didn't kill those first two?

04:57.070 --> 05:01.940
To make you think that I'd be 
unable to kill those remaining,

05:02.250 --> 05:05.950
leading you to let down your guard.

05:06.870 --> 05:08.680
<i>So I was right.</i>

05:09.220 --> 05:12.940
<i>He's a dark god, but he's still Glen Garia.</i>

05:13.430 --> 05:16.960
<i>He's cunning, never shows off,
never underestimates,</i>

05:16.960 --> 05:19.340
<i>and is as cool and collected as a machine.</i>

05:19.340 --> 05:21.170
<i>He's the ultimate top attacker.</i>

05:21.840 --> 05:22.670
<i>But...</i>

05:23.610 --> 05:26.680
<i>I already knew all that.</i>

05:26.880 --> 05:30.540
You have a tendency to 
escape to wishful thinking.

05:31.860 --> 05:34.070
<i>You're the one who taught me that...</i>

05:34.570 --> 05:37.570
<i>to make sure that we'd be able to kill you!</i>

05:38.010 --> 05:39.560
Skill activate!

05:39.560 --> 05:41.520
Sigurth Beast!

05:45.650 --> 05:48.200
Composite skill activate!

05:51.010 --> 05:52.450
<b>Futore</b>

05:51.360 --> 05:52.450
Futore!

05:58.150 --> 06:00.440
A combined skill with another person?!

06:00.440 --> 06:01.840
Ignis!

06:01.840 --> 06:02.800
<b>Ignis</b>

06:08.580 --> 06:10.970
Nothing you try will do any good!

06:19.510 --> 06:20.770
<i>He dodged it?!</i>

06:25.050 --> 06:26.640
What is going on?!

06:26.640 --> 06:30.940
<i>Right now, the present and the future 
appear to overlap in my eyes.</i>

06:31.620 --> 06:35.120
<i>The faint hints of information 
created when Glen moves</i>

06:35.780 --> 06:38.870
<i>are picked up by that double Sigurth Beast.</i>

06:39.790 --> 06:42.880
<i>It feels like the massive amount of 
information is burning up my brain,</i>

06:43.420 --> 06:46.630
<i>but Lululee's Sigurth Revive keeps me sane.</i>

06:51.450 --> 06:52.250
<i>Right.</i>

06:53.290 --> 06:54.210
Impossible!

06:54.610 --> 06:55.680
Imber!

06:55.680 --> 06:56.680
<b>Imber</b>

06:56.970 --> 06:58.850
This is nothing!

07:21.070 --> 07:23.520
Chant! Dia Chronos!

07:30.050 --> 07:32.970
Do you actually think you've 
surpassed a dark god?

07:33.220 --> 07:34.680
Inconceivable!

07:35.660 --> 07:38.850
It's over! Die!

07:42.500 --> 07:45.450
How?! How are you moving?!

07:56.240 --> 07:58.510
What is that power?!

07:58.510 --> 08:02.580
Are you telling me you can outdo a Dia skill?!

08:03.070 --> 08:04.580
Go back to the old Glen.

08:05.480 --> 08:06.960
If you can't do that...

08:06.960 --> 08:09.700
I'll crush your body along 
with the dark god's core!

08:10.770 --> 08:14.970
Is there no one that you wish 
you could see one more time?

08:16.620 --> 08:18.750
I will bring them back for you.

08:18.750 --> 08:21.490
If I eat all the humans here,

08:21.490 --> 08:23.950
I can turn back time as far as it takes.

08:24.900 --> 08:27.770
I can see your past.

08:28.400 --> 08:30.230
It makes you feel lonely

08:30.230 --> 08:33.340
when you lose someone you 
care about, does it not?

08:33.340 --> 08:35.480
The dead can't be brought back.

08:35.880 --> 08:39.240
And honestly, I'm not that lonely.

08:41.090 --> 08:44.870
Well, isn't that just terribly selfish of you?

08:45.210 --> 08:48.140
Every time you make a friend, 
is it, "Okay, next"?

08:48.550 --> 08:52.120
There could be no greater 
desecration of the dead!

08:52.520 --> 08:55.340
It doesn't matter if it's 
selfish or desecration.

08:55.800 --> 08:59.890
I've never once thought of 
myself as pure or righteous.

09:00.580 --> 09:06.250
I work my hardest the only way I know how 
because I don't want to feel that pain again.

09:06.250 --> 09:08.150
What about you, "Glen"?!

09:08.350 --> 09:09.420
What?

09:10.160 --> 09:13.600
It seems like all you can think 
about is reviving your daughter,

09:13.600 --> 09:18.690
but aren't the memories of the life 
you had with her just as precious?

09:18.690 --> 09:21.990
Sophistry! What good are memories?!

09:22.340 --> 09:25.000
They give those left behind 
the strength to live!

09:26.830 --> 09:31.500
The strength to get up in the morning 
when you'd rather go back to sleep!

09:31.970 --> 09:36.130
The strength to work a little harder,
even if you hate overtime!

09:36.680 --> 09:40.260
The strength to face forward 
just a little bit the next day!

09:42.180 --> 09:45.790
Didn't your daughter teach you 
something really important?

09:45.790 --> 09:47.140
Isn't it because of her

09:47.530 --> 09:49.490
that you are who you are now?!

09:51.260 --> 09:56.430
Before you think of stupid ideas like 
giving your own life to bring her back,

09:56.780 --> 10:01.410
try treasuring your memories of 
your time with her a little more!

10:03.160 --> 10:06.160
And more importantly...

10:06.160 --> 10:08.960
The one thing I want to say most of all is...

10:10.600 --> 10:19.470
Don't you dare forget your promise 
to set me free from working overtime!

10:35.920 --> 10:38.670
I'm sorry... I'm sorry,

10:39.800 --> 10:40.870
Lynn...

10:44.360 --> 10:46.410
Why couldn't I protect you...

10:47.170 --> 10:50.330
and that smile I cherished more than anything?

10:50.940 --> 10:54.350
I should have just told you honestly...

10:54.990 --> 10:58.340
I should have just said, "I love you."

11:00.170 --> 11:02.780
I love you, Dad!

11:08.870 --> 11:11.560
I wish you the best out there.

11:15.110 --> 11:17.790
Just when I thought I'd finished the training,

11:17.790 --> 11:21.260
I'm buried in overtime thanks 
to that massive dungeon!

11:27.740 --> 11:30.420
We'll never get this done if you fall asleep.

11:30.930 --> 11:33.230
I'm not falling asleep!

11:33.230 --> 11:35.820
I'm trying to rest one eye at a time.

11:35.820 --> 11:37.110
Look...

11:37.110 --> 11:40.510
You have to keep working <i>while</i>
you rest one eye at a time.

11:40.510 --> 11:42.640
Otherwise, the work will never get done.

11:42.640 --> 11:47.080
What?! But you're the only one who can do that!

11:47.080 --> 11:47.850
Hey.

11:47.850 --> 11:51.100
I'm kind of busy here!

11:51.510 --> 11:53.700
I-I know that!

11:53.700 --> 11:56.110
That's why I came after 
your window was closed!

11:56.450 --> 11:57.980
What do you want?

11:58.990 --> 12:00.610
Glen woke up.

12:10.480 --> 12:13.400
Alina! You're looking very well!

12:13.400 --> 12:15.840
I'm not well at all.

12:15.840 --> 12:18.840
I've had to work overtime every 
day and haven't had any sleep.

12:19.080 --> 12:23.090
That just means you've recovered 
enough to work overtime!

12:23.090 --> 12:25.240
Yeah, I guess so.

12:25.240 --> 12:29.350
Well, it's all thanks to your 
healing magic. I appreciate it.

12:29.610 --> 12:31.140
Lowe, are you doing okay?

12:31.140 --> 12:34.310
Hell no. I'm still in pain.

12:34.310 --> 12:37.190
Lowe was actually pretty severely hurt.

12:37.190 --> 12:39.490
I used Heal as emergency treatment,

12:39.490 --> 12:44.120
but his bones were, like... 
rammed deep into his organs.

12:45.340 --> 12:48.060
I can't believe he could 
even move in that state!

12:48.060 --> 12:51.290
I'd understand if it was someone like 
Jade, who's used to pain, but...

12:51.590 --> 12:54.860
Uh, no, it always hurts just as much for me.

12:55.090 --> 12:58.480
Lowe, did you undergo training to 
withstand torture or something?

12:58.480 --> 13:02.100
C'mon, don't say scary stuff like that.

13:02.100 --> 13:04.630
Little ol' Lowe is just real good at enduring.

13:04.630 --> 13:07.980
Come to think of it, you did some kind 
of weird fusion attack again, huh?

13:07.980 --> 13:10.520
It's not just some weird fusion attack!

13:10.520 --> 13:14.640
I practiced pretty hard to pull off that 
composite skill with Jade, you know!

13:15.520 --> 13:18.570
If we can master it, we should 
be able to broaden its range.

13:18.570 --> 13:20.150
Members of Silver Sword...

13:20.370 --> 13:23.150
and Miss Alina Clover.

13:23.780 --> 13:27.910
Thank you for saving Mister Glen.

13:31.390 --> 13:32.530
Why?

13:33.250 --> 13:35.660
Why didn't you kill me?

13:37.010 --> 13:39.000
Do you still have regrets?

13:39.330 --> 13:41.350
They will never go away.

13:41.350 --> 13:44.510
But it is also a fact that 
I have nothing left to try.

13:44.910 --> 13:47.760
I couldn't fully activate the dark god's core,

13:48.080 --> 13:50.640
so I remained alive as a human.

13:51.090 --> 13:54.010
The Dia skill within me is gone now.

13:54.010 --> 13:55.390
I can't use it anymore.

13:56.990 --> 13:59.650
But still, why did you let me live?!

14:00.550 --> 14:05.390
I used the position of guildmaster and 
so many adventurers for my own gain.

14:05.390 --> 14:09.890
If I had died, I could have 
at least redeemed myself.

14:12.090 --> 14:14.830
Quit acting like such a baby, you trashmaster!

14:16.330 --> 14:20.660
You and I have a promise between us 
that's more important than your life.

14:20.660 --> 14:24.420
I won't let you tell me you forgot 
your promise to free me from overtime!

14:24.420 --> 14:25.170
Wha?!

14:25.170 --> 14:27.070
Don't you "Wha?!" me!

14:27.070 --> 14:30.060
And what the hell is with that 
"is this the time for that?" look?!

14:30.060 --> 14:34.140
What more reason do I need to 
keep your sorry ass alive?!

14:34.140 --> 14:37.810
Uh, Alina, I think that's going a bit too far.

14:39.170 --> 14:42.640
If you thought you could get out 
of it by dying, you were wrong!

14:42.640 --> 14:47.180
You don't get to die until I don't 
have a single minute of overtime left!

14:49.260 --> 14:53.340
Is there ever gonna be a day when you don't 
have a single minute of overtime left?

14:53.340 --> 14:56.260
There will! Don't talk like that!

14:56.930 --> 15:00.330
So I can't even be permitted to die anymore.

15:00.750 --> 15:05.370
That's right. You don't actually 
think going through a little pain

15:05.370 --> 15:08.030
makes up for abandoning your 
responsibility, do you?

15:10.010 --> 15:13.770
So if I abandon my mountain 
of paperwork and just go home,

15:13.770 --> 15:15.690
will my overtime get easier?

15:15.690 --> 15:17.000
N-No...

15:17.000 --> 15:18.070
It's still gonna be there!

15:18.070 --> 15:22.870
The work won't go away 
until I confront it head-on!

15:22.870 --> 15:26.110
The same goes for a dark god or anything else!

15:26.350 --> 15:31.110
Alina... Overtime and a dark god 
aren't quite on the same scale.

15:33.260 --> 15:37.220
You know what you need to do for the 
next personnel shuffle, don't you?

15:37.720 --> 15:39.750
Y-Yes, I know.

15:44.310 --> 15:47.650
I can't forgive you for using 
us and Alina the way you did.

15:48.250 --> 15:52.400
But it's not as if things would've 
improved if you had died.

15:54.760 --> 15:59.050
More importantly, there's something 
we of Silver Sword want from you.

15:59.360 --> 16:02.110
Get rid of Alina's overtime.

16:02.110 --> 16:02.940
Right?

16:02.940 --> 16:04.350
That's right!

16:04.350 --> 16:05.900
No arguments here.

16:07.360 --> 16:10.410
I'll do whatever I can to 
the best of my ability.

16:10.410 --> 16:12.320
Is that how I atone?

16:12.700 --> 16:15.960
Glen, tell me everything you know.

16:16.360 --> 16:20.460
Who told you about the dark gods
 and the dark god's core?

16:20.910 --> 16:22.330
Who were you talking about?

16:22.530 --> 16:26.440
I don't mean to hide anything, 
but if you hear the name,

16:26.810 --> 16:30.340
all of you will become embroiled 
in an even greater calamity.

16:30.730 --> 16:32.590
An even greater calamity?

16:32.800 --> 16:35.260
Yes. The one who—

16:38.600 --> 16:39.340
Glen?!

16:41.960 --> 16:43.520
Skill activate!

16:43.500 --> 16:45.350
<b>Sigurth Revive</b>

16:43.520 --> 16:45.350
Sigurth Revive!

16:51.030 --> 16:53.320
Her Sigurth skill was repelled?!

16:56.630 --> 17:01.390
I can't remember... 
what that person looked like...

17:05.350 --> 17:07.290
He was silenced, huh?

17:07.960 --> 17:08.660
Yeah.

17:09.370 --> 17:13.220
It may have been the work of the 
person Glen was talking about.

17:14.180 --> 17:17.240
If Lululee's Sigurth skill was repelled...

17:18.380 --> 17:20.850
That means they can use Dia skills.

17:21.600 --> 17:26.920
Does this mean Glen was being used 
by someone else all this time?

17:27.290 --> 17:28.610
Excuse me!

17:28.990 --> 17:31.410
How long are you going to sit around chatting?

17:31.410 --> 17:33.610
Uh, I wouldn't call it "chatting."

17:33.610 --> 17:34.930
More importantly...

17:34.930 --> 17:37.490
What we should be dealing with now... is this!

17:38.910 --> 17:42.660
We're never going to finish all this!

17:42.660 --> 17:44.680
You'll help with our overtime, right?

17:46.290 --> 17:48.470
That sure is a lot.

17:48.830 --> 17:51.540
Even if we all helped,
could we finish it by morning?

17:51.540 --> 17:53.370
Huh? All of us?!

17:53.370 --> 17:56.050
Um, um, um, um...

17:56.050 --> 18:02.760
You did say earlier that Silver Sword 
wanted my overtime to go away, right?

18:02.760 --> 18:04.970
Er...

18:04.970 --> 18:07.540
So of course you'll help, right?

18:07.540 --> 18:10.940
Laila! Bring their share of the work over!

18:12.650 --> 18:15.440
Thank you all so much!

18:17.070 --> 18:19.210
Well, it's all yours!

18:19.210 --> 18:20.980
F-For real?

18:20.980 --> 18:22.410
That's ruthless.

18:23.260 --> 18:25.030
All yours!

18:25.030 --> 18:27.720
P-Please go easy on me!

18:38.400 --> 18:42.100
I wish I could've at least gotten 
time off for my birthday...

18:42.100 --> 18:44.970
Your proposal to improve the 
business wasn't accepted?

18:44.970 --> 18:46.000
Keep working.

18:46.000 --> 18:47.170
R-Right...

18:48.640 --> 18:54.480
The winning plan was one that hit all 
the points the counter chief likes most.

18:55.060 --> 18:56.560
What kind of plan was it?

18:56.560 --> 19:00.560
"Those with a large workload 
should reach out for help,"

19:00.560 --> 19:03.270
"and those with time to spare should help them."

19:03.270 --> 19:05.760
Just your typical "reach out 
and help a friend" thing.

19:05.760 --> 19:08.660
Well, that's... I don't know.

19:09.210 --> 19:14.460
Exactly. During busy periods, 
no one has time to spare.

19:14.460 --> 19:16.630
It's impossible to implement.

19:17.380 --> 19:20.490
<i>And even if anyone did have time to spare...</i>

19:21.100 --> 19:24.370
I-I'm done!

19:25.100 --> 19:27.590
<i>Way to stick it out to the end.</i>

19:27.590 --> 19:29.480
<i>Great job, Laila.</i>

19:29.740 --> 19:32.050
Mr. Executioner!

19:32.050 --> 19:34.440
Your words make it all worthwhile!

19:34.440 --> 19:37.220
Now I can work hard on my overtime!

19:38.400 --> 19:40.160
What are you even doing?

19:40.160 --> 19:43.660
Mr. Executioner is the only 
thing that can soothe my soul!

19:44.650 --> 19:49.590
Anyway, Ms. Alina, 
I'm not busy now, so I'll help you.

19:52.380 --> 19:54.750
Laila, you can go home.

19:54.750 --> 19:55.650
Huh?!

19:56.200 --> 19:58.740
Rest at home so you'll be good to go tomorrow.

19:59.500 --> 20:01.810
M-Ms. Alina...

20:02.450 --> 20:05.340
I'll just be going, then!

20:08.320 --> 20:10.770
If I shamelessly asked for help

20:10.770 --> 20:13.520
when someone wasn't busy,
I'd end up owing them,

20:13.520 --> 20:16.390
and I'd be obligated to help them next time.

20:17.750 --> 20:21.530
Well, yeah, I guess there's 
always some give and take.

20:22.040 --> 20:24.190
Oh, by the way, got a minute?

20:24.990 --> 20:26.070
For what?

20:31.660 --> 20:33.040
So, Alina...

20:34.180 --> 20:36.500
Would you take this?

20:37.420 --> 20:39.250
A guiding crystal?

20:39.580 --> 20:43.510
I told you, I have no intention 
of joining Silver Sword.

20:43.950 --> 20:47.030
This is one that failed to 
become a guiding crystal.

20:47.360 --> 20:49.000
It doesn't glow.

20:49.000 --> 20:51.640
It doesn't glow? Then what's the point?

20:51.640 --> 20:53.120
That's fine.

20:53.480 --> 20:58.300
It's better if a crystal doesn't glow as a 
notification that a friend's about to die.

20:59.270 --> 21:00.370
I guess so.

21:00.780 --> 21:04.530
So this is a prayer that nobody dies.

21:05.510 --> 21:07.880
Nobody dies, huh?

21:08.560 --> 21:10.340
But why give me this now?

21:10.340 --> 21:12.160
What brought on this change?

21:12.380 --> 21:18.140
Well, because... I made you feel bad 
during the new-employee training.

21:19.260 --> 21:22.580
You mean with that silly 
Image Improvement Campaign?

21:22.580 --> 21:26.260
You thought a gift would make 
me forgive you? How convenient.

21:26.580 --> 21:28.680
But that's not all this is!

21:29.380 --> 21:32.650
Alina... I won't die, okay?

21:32.930 --> 21:33.980
Huh?

21:34.780 --> 21:36.940
I won't let Lululee or Lowe die, either.

21:37.410 --> 21:42.930
I'll get stronger so you'll never 
have to fight any dark gods.

21:44.140 --> 21:46.460
Because I want you to always smile.

21:47.790 --> 21:49.950
It's a prayer for a lot of things.

21:53.350 --> 21:54.950
Would you please take it?

21:59.030 --> 22:00.070
<i>I know all that.</i>

22:01.150 --> 22:04.110
<i>I know Jade won't die so easily...</i>

22:05.540 --> 22:09.480
<i>and I know he'd give his 
life to protect his friends.</i>

22:13.730 --> 22:15.140
Alina?

22:15.290 --> 22:18.650
Well, I mean... it's pretty. So I'll keep it.

22:20.430 --> 22:21.240
Thanks.

22:25.250 --> 22:29.020
I'll give you something even 
better on your birthday!

22:29.470 --> 22:31.160
Maybe a huge house!

22:31.160 --> 22:33.130
That's okay. I already have a house.

22:33.130 --> 22:37.920
Actually... what do you want, anyway?
I don't have a clue.

22:37.920 --> 22:39.670
To clock out on time.

22:39.670 --> 22:43.670
Don't you have... like... anything else?

22:45.170 --> 22:46.420
Nope.

22:50.680 --> 22:53.180
Hang on, hang on, hang on, hang on!

22:53.180 --> 22:55.090
What?! There's still this much left?!

22:55.090 --> 22:56.430
There's <i>still</i> this much?!

22:58.680 --> 23:00.240
There's no end in sight.

23:00.920 --> 23:03.290
There's absolutely no end in sight!

23:04.070 --> 23:07.260
This is all because of that boss.

23:07.260 --> 23:12.990
As long as that boss is out there, 
I'm stuck in overtime hell forever!

23:13.390 --> 23:16.100
Bullshit! Bullshit! Bullshit! Bullshit!

23:16.100 --> 23:18.870
Overtime is nothing but bullshit!

23:19.310 --> 23:21.460
I swear I will...

23:21.460 --> 23:23.870
clock out on time!

23:24.840 --> 23:27.090
Jade! Lululee! Lowe!

